# A grating shorter than the beam truncates the Gaussian.
# Reference: numerical integration on a finer grid in NumPy.
title Gaussian-apodised grating 16 um long
grating angle=10 length=16
leak 1.0
apodise gaussian
expect radiated 0.99846782 1e-06
expect overlap 0.99754837 2e-05
expect efficiency 0.49800998 2e-05
expect position 7.99643518 0.005
